+      "prompt": "CONTEXT:\nExp6957 supplies exact outcome certificates for frozen mapping proposals.\nSelf-Reports Are Not Verification requires those environment outcomes, not\nconfidence or rationale, to govern memory. This task creates a sealed\nprospective sequence with related but non-identical reformulations. It\nfreezes opportunity and order before any learning arm runs.\n\nWork at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.\n\nEXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:\n- {project_root}/CLAUDE.md, {project_root}/CODEX.md, and\n  {project_root}/research-program.md\n- {project_root}/results/experiment_6955_reformulation_fixture.json\n- {project_root}/results/experiment_6957_smt_mapping_certification.json\n- {project_root}/python/carnot/learning/constraint_memory.py\n- {project_root}/results/experiment_5920_prospective_event_stream_admission.json\n- {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py\n- {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/learning/spec.md\n\nTASK:\nBuild and seal a chronological certificate sequence for prospective memory\nevaluation. Earlier exact-success mappings may be retrieved for later\nrelated events, but no current or future outcome may enter its own prompt.\nMeasure real memory opportunity, interference risk, and family separation.\n\nCONCRETE STEPS:\n0. PRECONDITIONS: require smt_certification_run_complete_score=1, exact\n   certificate and fixture rows, enough certified successes, deterministic\n   generators, and writable sealed checkpoints. On failure, write\n   blocked_certified_event_sequence with gate_check_summary.\n1. Add REQ-LEARN-6961 and tests first. Cover time reversal, future-label\n   leakage, isomorphic answer leakage, duplicate events, family collision,\n   no-op retrieval, zero headroom, copied certificates, and hash drift.\n2. Select only prior exact-success certificates as seed material. Never use\n   confidence, rationale, or a learned score as admission authority.\n3. Generate related but non-identical later formulations